B.ba=new A.aa(B.FZ,["Where Care Is Love","Egypt's registry for every pet","One record per microchip, opened at any member clinic with the owner's permission.","Sign in as a Pets4Pals family member","Join the Pets4Pals family","My account","Join","Create your account. Every member then verifies their identity with a national ID, to keep the family safe from fraud.","Full name","Mobile (optional)","Check the email address.","Confirm password","At least 8 characters.","The passwords do not match.","Join now","We could not create the account. Try again.","Too many people are joining right now. Please try again in an hour.","Already a member?","Not a member yet?","One more step","We sent a message to {email}. Open it and tap the link to activate your account, then sign in.","Found a pet?","Enter the microchip number to notify the owner.","Emergency help","Quick first-aid guidance until you reach a vet.","Clinic portal","Register pets, record visits and vaccinations.","Verify your account first to use the assistant.","Forgot your password?","Reset password","Write the email of your account. We will send you a link to choose a new password.","Send the link","If an account uses this email, a link is on its way. Open it on this device.","Choose a new password","Write your new password twice.","Save the new password","Your password was changed.","The password was not changed. The link may have expired; ask for a new one.","Account verification","Verify your identity","To protect you and every member from the site being used for anything unlawful, all members must verify their identity. Verification can take 24 to 48 hours, and you will receive an email with the result.","Details","Photos","Send","Account type","Pet owner","Vet / clinic","Pet shop","Seller / breeder","Full name","Exactly as on your national ID","Write your full name as on the ID (at least 3 names).","National ID number","14 digits","Birth date","City / area","Address","Street, building, floor","Write the address on your ID. If you live somewhere else, we may ask for a document that shows your address.","Next","Back","The camera opens here. Take each photo now, in good light, with the whole card visible and readable.","ID card - front","ID card - back","Selfie holding your ID","Document","Tap to open the camera","Done - tap to retake","Uploading securely...","I agree that Pets4Pals keeps my ID photos and details privately to verify my identity and protect members from fraud. Only the review team can see them, and they are never shown on the site.","Send for review","The photo did not upload. Check the internet and try again.","Please tick the agreement first.","Check the national ID number (14 digits).","You must be 18 or older.","This national ID is already used by another account.","Take all three photos first.","Sending failed. Try again.","Under review","Thank you! We are checking your details and photos. Verification can take 24 to 48 hours. We will email you the result, and you can also see it here.","We need one more document","Please photograph what is requested below, then send.","Photograph a document","Verification not accepted","We could not verify this account. Reason:","Approved!","Your identity is verified. Pay the one-time activation fee of {fee} EGP to activate your account.","Your account is active","Welcome to the Pets4Pals family.","Pay with PayPal","Online payment opens very soon. Our team will contact you to complete the payment.","The payment did not go through. Try again.","Payment was cancelled. You can try again whenever you like.","Confirming your payment...","No camera was found on this device. Use a phone or a device with a camera.","We need the camera. Allow camera access in your browser settings, then try again.","The photo could not be taken. Try again.","Place the card inside the frame. Make sure there is no glare and all text is clear.","Hold your ID card under your face so both your face and the card are clear.","Place the document inside the frame so all text is clear.","Switch camera","Retake","Use photo","Take photo","This page is for the Pets4Pals team only.","Verification requests","Review request","To review","Awaiting payment","Documents requested","All","Nothing here right now.","just now","{h} hours ago","Over 36 hours","This mobile number is used by another account","Status","Under review","Documents requested","Rejected","Awaiting payment","Active","Approve","Ask for documents","What should they send? (e.g. electricity bill with the address)","Reject","Reason (the member will see it)","Confirm payment received","Payment reference","age {a}","male","female","Check before approving:\n1. The face in the selfie matches the ID photo.\n2. The name and national ID number match the card.\n3. The address on the back of the ID matches the address typed (if not, ask for a document).\n4. The card looks original: no edits, no screen photo.","No photos found.","Care guide","Rabies, parvo, fleas, ticks, feeding, summer heat and more.","Everyday care for your pet","Simple tips that keep your pet healthy, from feeding to summer heat.","General guidance only. It does not replace your vet, who knows your pet. For danger signs, open Emergency help now.","Read the tips","Show less","Signs, treatment and prevention","Common diseases in Egypt","How to spot them, what to do and how to protect your pet.","Everyday care","Feeding, vaccines, heat, grooming and more.","Signs","Treatment","Prevention","Marketplace","Food, supplies and pets from verified sellers.","Coming soon","We're building this part now.","Microchip number","15 digits","The microchip number is 15 digits.","Search","The database is not connected yet.","No pet is registered with this number.","Registered pet","Reported lost","We will notify the owner. Their number stays private.","Something went wrong. Try again.","Go to a vet now if you see any of these signs. Do not wait.","Heavy bleeding that does not stop","Difficulty breathing or blue gums","Swallowed poison, medicine or chocolate","Seizures or collapse","Swollen, hard belly with retching (dogs)","Straining to urinate with nothing coming out (cats)","The assistant gives temporary first-aid advice only. It does not diagnose or prescribe.","The AI assistant will be connected in the next step.","Sign in","Email","Password","Sign in","Sign out","Wrong email or password.","Required","Registrations left","Subscription until","The subscription has ended. Renew it to keep using the portal.","This clinic is waiting for Pets4Pals to verify its documents.","Register a new pet","Open a pet's record","This account is not linked to a clinic.","Pet","Owner","Pet name","Species","Dog","Cat","Bird","Rabbit","Other","Breed","Sex","Male","Female","Unknown","Color","Date of birth","Owner name","Mobile","11 digits starting with 01","Email (optional)","Governorate","Register (uses 1 credit)","This microchip is already registered.","No registrations left. Contact Pets4Pals to top up.","Enter the microchip number. If this clinic can't see the pet yet, ask the owner for the code in their Pets4Pals app.","Owner's code","6 digits","Open","This clinic can't see this pet yet. Ask the owner for their code.","Wrong or expired code.","Visits","Vaccinations","Add visit","Add vaccination","No visits yet.","No vaccinations yet.","Reason for visit","Diagnosis","Treatment","Weight (kg)","Notes","Vaccine","Given on","Next dose","Save","Cancel","Saved.","Records can't be edited or deleted after saving.","Another clinic","My pets","No pets are linked to this account yet. Pets are registered at a member clinic.","Medical record","Give a clinic access","Code for the clinic","Give this code to the clinic with the microchip number. It works once, within 15 minutes.","Done","Report lost","Back home","Microchip","Pick a date","Visit date","Ask the AI assistant","Tell me what is happening: the type of pet, its age, and what you see. I will tell you what to do until you reach a vet.","Describe what is happening\u2026","Send","The assistant is writing\u2026","You have reached today's message limit. If this is urgent, go to a vet now.","The assistant is being set up. If this is urgent, go to a vet now.","The assistant could not reply. Try again, and go to a vet if it is urgent.","Go to a vet now","See a vet today","Watch at home for now","Pets4Pals member clinics","No member clinics are listed yet. Go to the nearest vet.","Call","Signs that need a vet right away","My dog keeps vomiting","My cat is not eating","My dog ate chocolate","A wound that is bleeding","New conversation","AI assistant \xb7 Plus plan","Instant first-aid guidance for your registered pets, any time of day. Available to owners on the Plus plan.","Your account is not on the Plus plan yet. Subscriptions open soon.","Sign in to use the assistant","\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629"],t.w)
